# NEEDS NATIVE REVIEW: translated by Claude, 2026-10
#: web/templates/index.html:2 web/templates/index.html:7
msgid "Which online services in Taiwan accept resident ID numbers?"
msgstr "台灣有哪些線上服務接受外來人口統一證號？"

# NEEDS NATIVE REVIEW: translated by Claude, 2026-10
#: web/templates/index.html:3
msgid ""
"A public scorecard of how Taiwanese online services treat ARC holders, plus free validation code "
"that accepts every legal ID number format."
msgstr "公開評比台灣線上服務對居留證持有人的待遇，並提供可接受所有合法證號格式的免費驗證程式碼。"

# NEEDS NATIVE REVIEW: translated by Claude, 2026-10
#: web/templates/index.html:8
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Foreign residents hold an Alien Resident Certificate (ARC) number instead of a national ID. Many "
"websites reject it. This site scores %(count)s services on how they treat ARC holders, and gives "
"developers the code to fix theirs."
msgstr "外籍居民持有的是居留證（ARC）上的外來人口統一證號，而非身分證字號，但許多網站不接受。本站針對 %(count)s 個服務評比其對居留證持有人的待遇，並提供開發者修正驗證程式的程式碼。"

# NEEDS NATIVE REVIEW: translated by Claude, 2026-10
#: web/templates/index.html:10
msgid "See the report"
msgstr "查看報告"

