#: web/templates/index.html:25
msgid ""
"Each service is scored on whether it accepts legacy and new ARC numbers, offers the same service "
"to non-citizens, and lets them register online. Click a service for the full breakdown and its "
"history."
msgstr "每個服務依據是否接受舊式與新式外來人口統一證號、是否對非國民提供相同服務、以及非國民是否可線上註冊來評分。點選服務可查看完整評分與變更紀錄。"

